---
// Универсальный футер для всех страниц
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a href="/habitwood-landing/" class="footer-logo">Дерево привычек</a>
      <span class="footer-tagline">Визуальный трекер привычек</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="Навигация и правовая информация">
      <a href="/habitwood-landing/articles/">Статьи о привычках</a>
      <a href="https://owevyat.github.io/habitwood/privacy.html">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
      <a href="https://owevyat.github.io/habitwood/terms.html">Условия использования</a>
      <a href="mailto:owevyat.support@gmail.com">owevyat.support@gmail.com</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Дерево привычек. Все права защищены.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style is:global>
  .footer {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem calc(2.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 100%);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .footer-logo:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .footer-tagline {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .footer-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-nav a {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease-out);
    position: relative;
  }

  .footer-nav a::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -3px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-out);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .footer-nav a:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .footer-nav {
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .footer { padding: 3rem 2rem; }

    .footer-inner {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: left;
      gap: 2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-brand { align-items: flex-start; }

    .footer-copy {
      padding-top: 0;
      border-top: none;
      max-width: none;
      width: auto;
    }
  }
</style>